mu4e-autotask NEWS -- history of user-visible changes

* Changes in mu4e-autotask 1.1.0 (unreleased)

** Bug Fixes

*** `mu4e-autotask-browse-url-matching' decodes more character references
    Besides `&amp;', the captured URL now has `;'-terminated decimal
    and hexadecimal HTML character references, `&lt;', `&gt;',
    `&quot;' and `&apos;', and the uppercase `&AMP;', `&LT;', `&GT;'
    and `&QUOT;' decoded, in a single pass.  An href such as
    "pay?id&#x3D;7" used to be browsed with the reference intact.
    Tabs, and CR and LF decoded from references, are then removed, as
    a browser does.

* Changes in mu4e-autotask 1.0.0 (2026-08-21)

Initial release.
